        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For all of our product candidates, we intend to identify and qualify additional manufacturers to provide the active pharmaceutical ingredient and fill-and-finish services prior to seeking regulatory approval.",
        "start_character": 70192,
        "end_character": 70400
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Government authorities in the United States, at the federal, state, and local level, and other countries extensively regulate, among other things, the research, development, nonclinical and clinical testing, manufacture, quality control, approval, labeling, packaging, storage, record-keeping, promotion, advertising, distribution, post-approval monitoring and reporting, marketing, and export and import of products such as those we are developing.",
        "start_character": 88533,
        "end_character": 88982
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to regulations in the United States, we will be subject to a variety of foreign regulations governing clinical trials and commercial sales and distribution of our product candidates to the extent we choose to develop or sell any product candidates outside of the United States.",
        "start_character": 139222,
        "end_character": 139511
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Using our proprietary drug discovery platform, we are developing a pipeline of precision medicine product candidates that target key muscle proteins and modulators to address a broad array of muscle diseases.",
        "start_character": 4297,
        "end_character": 4505
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We maintain agreements with our manufacturers that include confidentiality and intellectual property provisions to protect our proprietary rights related to our product candidates.",
        "start_character": 69575,
        "end_character": 69755
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We rely and expect to continue to rely for the foreseeable future, on third-party contract development and manufacturing organizations (CDMOs) to produce our product candidates for preclinical and clinical testing, as well as for commercial manufacture if our product candidates receive marketing approval.",
        "start_character": 69074,
        "end_character": 69380
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Building upon our success in designing small molecule inhibitors of fast skeletal myosin, we are leveraging our proprietary drug discovery platform and capabilities to create precision medicines for muscle diseases with high levels of unmet need.",
        "start_character": 7313,
        "end_character": 7559
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "By positioning ourselves as a trusted partner that moves with thoughtful urgency, we will continue to work to understand the needs of patients in order to inform our development of sevasemten, EDG-7500, EDG-15400, and other programs for severe muscle diseases.",
        "start_character": 5113,
        "end_character": 5373
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our science-driven culture places patients first as we start with their unmet needs and then work towards developing therapies to help address the significant challenges of serious muscle diseases.",
        "start_character": 211,
        "end_character": 408
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also aware of several early-stage preclinical HCM gene therapy assets being developed by DiNAQOR, DINA-003 and DINA-001, the latter in collaboration with BioMarin Pharmaceuticals (BMN-293/DINA-001).",
        "start_character": 79439,
        "end_character": 79644
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are aware of several preclinical HCM programs including: JN-210, a microRNA activating gene therapy approach being developed by Jaan Biotherapeutics;",
        "start_character": 79057,
        "end_character": 79209
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020112",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020112-9c7160f39b11db0a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020112",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
